        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 46.29,
          "end": 47.9,
          "en": "But that's no problem,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 47.9,
          "end": 49.88,
          "en": "we can get rid of the notification here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 49.88,
          "end": 54.54,
          "en": "and cut it and remove its import,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 54.54,
          "end": 57.52,
          "en": "and instead of just use the layout component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 57.52,
          "end": 61.93,
          "en": "because that also is a wrapper around all our other content.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 61.93,
          "end": 65.26,
          "en": "And it's the perfect component for rendering a notification.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 65.26,
          "end": 68.1,
          "en": "Also, if we have a look at its name, layout,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 68.1,
          "end": 73.1,
          "en": "it is per definition, a wrapper for visual content.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 73.46000000000001,
          "end": 76.05,
          "en": "And therefore, if I go to my layout component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 76.05,
          "end": 78.75,
          "en": "I'll simply add the notification there,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 78.75,
          "end": 81.01,
          "en": "and then of course also add the import",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 81.01,
          "end": 85.873,
          "en": "for the notification component from the UI folder like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 86.82,
          "end": 88.76,
          "en": "And now in the layout component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 88.76,
          "end": 91.43,
          "en": "we can tap into our Context.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 91.43,
          "end": 94.38,
          "en": "And for that I'll import the use Context hook",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 94.38,
          "end": 96.22999999999999,
          "en": "which allows us to do that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 96.22999999999999,
          "end": 100.45,
          "en": "We can call use Context and then pass the Context",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 100.45,
          "end": 102.87,
          "en": "to which we want to establish a connection",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 102.87,
          "end": 106.22,
          "en": "as a argument to use Context.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 106.22,
          "end": 107.33,
          "en": "So to make that work,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 107.33,
          "end": 111.03999999999999,
          "en": "we should import the Context to which we want to connect.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 111.03999999999999,
          "end": 113.77000000000001,
          "en": "And that's the Notification Context,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 113.77000000000001,
          "end": 117.18,
          "en": "not the Notification Context Provider,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 117.18,
          "end": 120.35,
          "en": "but just the Notification Context,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 120.35,
          "end": 125.35,
          "en": "because I just want to connect to this Context object here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 126.75,
          "end": 130.63,
          "en": "So not the provider component, but this Context object,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 130.63,
          "end": 134.1,
          "en": "this one, which is exported as a default.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 134.1,
          "end": 137.15,
          "en": "That's what I need for use Context.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 137.15,
          "end": 138.88,
          "en": "So in the layout component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 138.88,
          "end": 143.66,
          "en": "that's what I'll import from my store folder.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 143.66,
          "end": 147.54,
          "en": "So for my store Notification Context file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 147.54,
          "end": 152.54,
          "en": "So pass Notification Context as a argument to use Context",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 152.77,
          "end": 157.083,
          "en": "and that gives us access to that Context value.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 158.12,
          "end": 160.07999999999998,
          "en": "Now we can use that Context",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 160.07999999999998,
          "end": 163.52,
          "en": "to call, show, or a hide notification,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 163.52,
          "end": 166.93,
          "en": "or to get the current notification data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 166.93,
          "end": 170.13,
          "en": "And that's what we need here in this layout component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 170.13,
          "end": 172.773,
          "en": "to conditionally show the notification.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 173.82999999999998,
          "end": 176.48,
          "en": "So here I'll then get access to the notification,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 176.48,
          "end": 178.143,
          "en": "and I'll name this activeNotification.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 181.1,
          "end": 184.82,
          "en": "So I'll store it in notification, managed by my Context",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 184.82,
          "end": 187.67,
          "en": "in a constant here in this component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 187.67,
          "end": 189.56,
          "en": "And if that is not null,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 189.56,
          "end": 193.34,
          "en": "so if we have an activeNotification in our Context,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 193.34,
          "end": 195.97,
          "en": "then I want to render this notification",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 195.97,
          "end": 200.35,
          "en": "with the data stored in activeNotification.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 200.35,
          "end": 203.36,
          "en": "So we want to render notification conditionally,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 203.36,
          "end": 206.04,
          "en": "and we can do it as we always do it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 206.04,
          "end": 211.04,
          "en": "with this syntax here, and then just populate the props here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 212.15,
          "end": 216.75,
          "en": "with the active values from the active notification.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 216.75,
          "end": 219.27,
          "en": "So activeNotification.title,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 219.27,
          "end": 223.7,
          "en": "and also set the message to activeNotification.message,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 223.7,
          "end": 225.29,
          "en": "and for the status,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 225.29,
          "end": 229.253,
          "en": "I'll set this to activeNotification.status.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 230.39,
          "end": 233.93,
          "en": "So now this notification component is rendered",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 233.93,
          "end": 237.73,
          "en": "whenever we have an activeNotification in our store,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 237.73,
          "end": 239.063,
          "en": "in our Context.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 240.69,
          "end": 244.52,
          "en": "At the moment though, we never have an activeNotification",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 244.52,
          "end": 246.47,
          "en": "because we have no place",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 246.47,
          "end": 249.67,
          "en": "that would trigger the show notification handler",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 249.67,
          "end": 254.1,
          "en": "by calling show notification on the Context object.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 254.1,
          "end": 256.24,
          "en": "And that's what I want to change now.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 256.24,
          "end": 259.12,
          "en": "Now that all the Context is set up,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 259.12,
          "end": 261.54,
          "en": "I want to dive into the components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 261.54,
          "end": 265.15,
          "en": "where we do send http requests",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 265.15,
          "end": 267.88,
          "en": "to then call show notification",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 267.88,
          "end": 270.35,
          "en": "from inside those components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 270.35,
          "end": 273.43,
          "en": "to show and update that notification",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 273.43,
          "end": 275.613,
          "en": "with the appropriate data.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
